-- Phase 5 content, Bucket 1: materialized item_template stats for the 52 Two-Hand weapons whose 25% DPS boost actually
-- moved a rounded value (dps_delta itself already applied via rev_1788395167861301538.sql). Re-run of the first attempt
-- (rev_1788395167861853129.sql, deleted) -- that one's guard included dmg_min1/dmg_max1, and 52 of 54 UPDATEs silently
-- affected 0 rows: those FLOAT(32) columns already held a *computed* value from the original conversion pass, and
-- round-tripping that through Python's float repr and back doesn't reliably reproduce the same stored bit pattern. This
-- version guards on the exact int-typed stat columns only and sets dmg_min1/dmg_max1 unconditionally whenever a guarded
-- column changes.

